      "field": "text_42",
      "shape_id": 42,
      "shape_name": "文本框 17",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 78,
      "source_sample_chars": 39,
      "source_text": "管理层或团队根据公司战略目标和部门需求，制定具体任务，并将任务分配给相关员工。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        467.1,
        92.1,
        351.7,
        41.9
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_43",
      "shape_id": 43,
      "shape_name": "文本框 17",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 94,
      "source_sample_chars": 47,
      "source_text": "在执行任务之前，确保所需的资源，人力、物资、资金、工具等，已经准备到位，以保证工作的顺利开展。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        467.1,
        183.8,
        351.7,
        41.9
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_44",
      "shape_id": 44,
      "shape_name": "文本框 17",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 74,
      "source_sample_chars": 37,
      "source_text": "员工根据任务要求开始执行工作，团队经理进行实时监控，确保项目进度符合预期。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        467.1,
        271.8,
        351.7,
        41.9
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_45",
      "shape_id": 45,
      "shape_name": "文本框 17",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 102,
      "source_sample_chars": 51,
      "source_text": "在任务完成的过程中或完成后，进行质量检查，确保交付物符合要求。反馈机制能够帮助改进工作流程和员工表现。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        467.1,
        360.5,
        351.7,
        41.9
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_46",
